      "invariants": [
        "Totus Central module without POSTPV or parallel authentication dependency",
        "cash isolated by store drawer and session",
        "Cashier cash reports include only the drawer whose reconciliation access was authorized, including explicit historical session queries",
        "uncertain remote order cannot be blindly resubmitted",
        "confirmation requires remote payment state lines and stock readback",
        "server-only PostgreSQL journal commits order confirmation and payment events atomically",
        "one active physical drawer session and one remote cart dispatch across workers",
        "insufficient stock requires explicit server-loaded workstation policy and sealed native cart permission without changing webshop stock policy; default refusal and attributed stock readback remain mandatory",
        "optional required quantity selection preserves the ticket on cancellation; product minima, remaining stock, scoped preferences and account disposal remain enforced",
        "unit price overrides require explicit saved options, current edit permission and scoped native capability; catalogue prices remain unchanged and native quote/payment evidence remains authoritative",
        "Private sale notes are sealed with the owned cart, required by server policy when configured, read back from a single private native Message, and excluded from customer documents and display",
        "Receipt original prices and item reductions use historical native order snapshots, preserve recorded tax and rounding, keep cart reductions separate and disclose no amounts in gift documents"
      ]
    },
